## 4. Type Safety

### Specify SerializedStyles Type

Explicitly type style function returns for better type safety.

**✅ Best Practice:**

```typescript
import { css, type SerializedStyles } from '@emotion/react'

const getTextStyle = (fontSize: number, fontWeight: number): SerializedStyles =>
  css({
    fontSize: `${fontSize}px`,
    fontWeight: fontWeight,
  })
```

**❌ No explicit type:**

```typescript
// ❌ Relies on type inference
const getTextStyle = (fontSize: number, fontWeight: number) =>
  css({
    fontSize: `${fontSize}px`,
    fontWeight: fontWeight,
  })
```

