## 10. Media Queries

### Responsive Styles

**✅ Best Practice:**

```typescript
// Define breakpoints as constants
const breakpoints = {
  mobile: '@media (max-width: 767px)',
  tablet: '@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1023px)',
  desktop: '@media (min-width: 1024px)',
} as const

const containerStyles = css({
  padding: '16px',

  [breakpoints.mobile]: {
    padding: '8px',
  },

  [breakpoints.tablet]: {
    padding: '12px',
  },

  [breakpoints.desktop]: {
    padding: '24px',
  },
})
```

