## 11. Global Styles

### Define Global Styles

```typescript
import { Global, css } from '@emotion/react'

const globalStyles = css({
  '*': {
    boxSizing: 'border-box',
    margin: 0,
    padding: 0,
  },
  'html, body': {
    height: '100%',
    fontFamily: '-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif',
  },
})

const App = () => {
  return (
    <>
      <Global styles={globalStyles} />
      {/* rest of app */}
    </>
  )
}
```

