## 14. Checklist

When using Emotion in your project, verify these items:

- [ ] `jsxImportSource: "@emotion/react"` configured in tsconfig.app.json
- [ ] Style functions defined outside components
- [ ] Props separated into behavior and styling types (for components with 3+ style props)
- [ ] Style functions use explicit destructuring (not `{ ...styles }`)
- [ ] `useMemo` used for dynamic styles
- [ ] `SerializedStyles` type specified
- [ ] Default values set in Props destructuring (for Storybook compatibility)
- [ ] Theme type extended (`emotion.d.ts`)
- [ ] Object styles used (instead of template literals)
- [ ] Render delegation pattern uses `Slottable`
- [ ] Conditional styles written clearly
- [ ] Nested selectors used only when necessary
- [ ] Breakpoints defined as constants
- [ ] `!important` usage minimized
- [ ] Global styles use `<Global>` component

